1
00:00:00,474 --> 00:00:02,844
You're right, the party's fantastic!
Tell me more.

2
00:00:03,043 --> 00:00:06,643
(Howard:)I haven't heard enough about it,
because hearing about that never gets old!

3
00:00:06,813 --> 00:00:10,473
- Is this about the space thing again?
- I'm not allowed to talk about it...

4
00:00:10,684 --> 00:00:15,314
(Howard:)...but since you brought it up,
I went to space. Space, space, space!

5
00:00:15,822 --> 00:00:18,352
Oh, Drinky Smurf!

6
00:00:20,093 --> 00:00:23,393
(Bernadette:)- Can I talk to you for a second?
- Great, now I'm in trouble.

7
00:00:23,663 --> 00:00:25,183
(Howard:)You happy?

8
00:00:26,066 --> 00:00:28,596
(Bernadette:)You, out!

9
00:00:29,836 --> 00:00:31,096
(Bernadette:)You are being very rude.

10
00:00:31,505 --> 00:00:34,595
(Howard:)No I'm not. They're all being rude,
and you're being rude.

11
00:00:34,841 --> 00:00:36,001
(Bernadette:)Me? What did I do?

12
00:00:36,209 --> 00:00:42,739
"Oh, Howie,
stop talking about space so much."

13
00:00:42,983 --> 00:00:45,543
"Nobody likes it."

14
00:00:46,987 --> 00:00:49,417
(Bernadette(in a gruff voice):)I don't sound like that.

15
00:00:51,358 --> 00:00:53,728
(Howard:)You're supposed to be on my side.

16
00:00:53,927 --> 00:00:55,987
(Bernadette:)I'm always on your side.

17
00:00:56,196 --> 00:00:59,226
(Howard:)Then why are you trying to
take this away from me?

18
00:00:59,432 --> 00:01:04,302
(Howard:)Being an astronaut is the coolest thing
I'm ever going to do...

